xnu 0296: the window is full, and jetsam was compiled out

`VM_BASE` listed `memorystatus` but not `jetsam`, so `CONFIG_JETSAM` was 0:
per-process limits were refused (launchd's 50 MB high watermark came back
EINVAL), the pressure policy was a stub, and nothing killed on a footprint of
its own. Enable it. The kernel builds against the macOS SDK, which defines
`XNU_TARGET_OS_OSX`, so the app-swap sizing block that `CONFIG_JETSAM` reads
does not compile; the port has no swap volume, so the limits are inert and are
given the non-OSX values.

The memory line gains the queues it was missing (`purge`, `throttled`,
`cleaned`, the initial wired pool) and the `VMSTAT` line says what the
compressor holds and where the memorystatus thresholds sit. Measured on the
864 MiB window: free + speculative + wire + active + inactive is 616 MiB and
the compressor holds another 221 MiB, so the window is full and the queues are
empty - the fix is a larger window, not a leak.

diff --git a/bsd/dev/mondrian_sample.c b/bsd/dev/mondrian_sample.c
--- a/bsd/dev/mondrian_sample.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/mondrian_sample.c
@@ -237,6 +237,10 @@
 		extern unsigned int vm_page_free_count, vm_page_speculative_count;
 		extern unsigned int vm_page_wire_count, vm_page_active_count;
 		extern unsigned int vm_page_inactive_count;
+		extern unsigned int vm_page_purgeable_count;
+		extern unsigned int vm_page_throttled_count;
+		extern unsigned int vm_page_cleaned_count;
+		extern unsigned int vm_page_wire_count_initial;
 		/* 16 KiB pages: count * 16 is KiB, >> 10 is MiB. */
 		extern uint64_t mondrian_surface_wired_bytes(void);
 		extern uint32_t mondrian_surface_live_count(void);
@@ -244,12 +248,17 @@
 		extern uint32_t mondrian_gpu_buffer_count_total(void);
 
 		printf("MONDRIAN MEM: free %uMiB spec %uMiB wire %uMiB active %uMiB inactive %uMiB"
+		    " purge %uMiB thr %uMiB clean %uMiB kinit %uMiB"
 		    " surf %uMiB/%u gpu %uMiB/%u\n",
 		    (vm_page_free_count * 16) >> 10,
 		    (vm_page_speculative_count * 16) >> 10,
 		    (vm_page_wire_count * 16) >> 10,
 		    (vm_page_active_count * 16) >> 10,
 		    (vm_page_inactive_count * 16) >> 10,
+		    (vm_page_purgeable_count * 16) >> 10,
+		    (vm_page_throttled_count * 16) >> 10,
+		    (vm_page_cleaned_count * 16) >> 10,
+		    (vm_page_wire_count_initial * 16) >> 10,
 		    (unsigned)(mondrian_surface_wired_bytes() >> 20),
 		    mondrian_surface_live_count(),
 		    (unsigned)(mondrian_gpu_buffer_bytes_total() >> 20),

